ReplayLab LEO NTN ABR runs: licence terms

This dataset combines simulation outputs with video segments that come from third parties.
They are licensed separately.

1. Simulation outputs

   Every file except the video segments (runs/*/videos/*/r*/seg_*.mp4): the logs, run.json,
   summary.json, the JSON Lines files, video.json and runs.csv.

   Licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0 International License (CC BY 4.0).
   https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/legalcode

2. Video segments of Big Buck Bunny

   runs/big_buck_bunny_*/videos/big_buck_bunny/
   Big Buck Bunny, (c) copyright 2008, Blender Foundation, www.bigbuckbunny.org.
   Licensed under the Creative Commons Attribution 3.0 License (CC BY 3.0).
   https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/3.0/legalcode
   The segments are re-encoded at six qualities (250 kbps to 12 Mbps).

3. Video segments of the Pexels videos

   runs/chef_cooking_*/, runs/peace_autumn_lake_*/, runs/pexels_30886101_*/ and
   runs/pexels_34797065_*/ (their videos/ folders).
   From Pexels (https://www.pexels.com), under the Pexels License
   (https://www.pexels.com/license/), which applies as published by Pexels. The segments
   are re-encoded at six qualities for the simulation and are shared for research and
   reproduction of the simulations only. They may not be sold, offered on a stock photo,
   video or wallpaper platform, or used to train, fine-tune or evaluate machine-learning
   models.

The video files are provided as they are, without warranty. Rights in the videos remain with
their owners.
